WHAT IS ZFinger?
~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~
 
 ZFinger is an Arexx PFile for C-Net v2.30+ that does the following 
 things:
 
   1.  Lets your users write and edit thier own registries
 
   2.  Lets your users read each other's registries 
 
   3.  Lets you edit your user's registries

 
INSTALLATION - MUST READ!!
~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~
 
 Before we begin, copy the following files:
 
 EReg.arx		Edit Registry program (for users).
			Put it in "Pfiles:ZRegistry/" or something.
 
 SReg.arx		Edit Registry program (for the sysop).
			Put it in the same place as "EReg.arx".
 
 VReg.arx		View Registry program (for users).
 			Put it in the same place as "EReg.arx".
 
 ZChk.arx		Checks to see if users have registry at logon.
			Put it in the same place as "EReg.arx".
 
 ZRegistry.brief	Text file used by EReg.arx program.
			Put it in the same place as "EReg.arx".
 
 ZRegistry.doc		What you are reading now.
			Might be good idea to keep around but.... :)
 
 ZRegistry.help		Another Text file used by the EReg.arx program.
			Put it in the same place as "EReg.arx".
 
 ZRegistry.history	Text file telling you about ZRegistry's history.
			Well.. I'd delete this..
 
 ZZZZPURG.Displayme	Neet-o BBS advertisment text file.
			Upload to every other bbs you call.
 
 _zreg			ACSII data file (an example registry)
			DOWATCHALIKE with it... feel free to nuke it.
 


 Ok. Now..

   1. First load up a text editor, and load up the EReg, SReg, VReg, and
      VChk file and change it to meat your needs (paying attention mostly
      to the "path1" and "bbs" variables.


   2. Next load up your bbsmenu file and under the 'Avalible Everywhere' 
      thingy add these lines...

	ER, Edit Registry |\#0pfiles:zregistry/EReg.arx\
	VR, View Registry |\#0pfiles:zregistry/VReg.arx\

   3. Then load up your bbsmenu file and under the 'Avalible Everywhere' 
      thingy add this line...

	SR, Sysop Registry |\#0pfiles:zregistry/SReg.arx\

   4. Finally load up your sys.welcome file and add the following line to
      it somewhere...

	\#0pfiles:zregistry/ZChk.arx\


RUNNING ZFinger_v2.1 & ZFinger[check]_v2.1
~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~
 
 Simply type "ER", "VR", or "SR" from the amy menu and it should all be
 self-explanatory.
 
 


